<!--
  The status-bar icon for every notification (downloads, reminders).

  Android draws a notification's small icon from its alpha channel only, so
  the full-colour launcher tile showed up as a plain white square. This is the
  "R" of the logo as a solid white silhouette; setColor(brand_green) on the
  notification tints it green in the shade.
-->
